<title>UK: Key points from BCC quarterly UK economic survey.</title>
<headline>Key points from BCC quarterly UK economic survey.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the key findings from the British Chambers of Commerce (BCC) economic survey for the third quarter.</p>
<p>The BCC survey covered 7,965 British companies in both services and manufacturing.</p>
<p>All figures are expressed as a percentage balance, except categories asterisked, which show a pure percentage.</p>
<p>						 Q3 1996     Q2 1996</p>
<p>MANUFACTURING</p>
<p>Were domestic deliveries</p>
<p> up over the past 3 months?		25	    19</p>
<p>Were export deliveries up</p>
<p> over the past 3 months?		   27	    28</p>
<p>Do you expect to increase</p>
<p> workforce in the next 3 months?	 19	    11</p>
<p>Have you experienced difficulties</p>
<p> in recruiting staff in last 3 mths?*  64	    63</p>
<p>Have you revised up investment</p>
<p>plans for plant and machinery</p>
<p> in past three months?		     22	    19</p>
<p>Will turnover improve in</p>
<p> next 12 months?			     62	    54</p>
<p>Will profitability improve in</p>
<p> next 12 months?			     45	    39</p>
<p>Is your firm operating at</p>
<p> full capacity?*			     42	    33</p>
<p>Has your cash flow improved in</p>
<p> the last three months?		    11	     5</p>
<p>SERVICES</p>
<p>Were domestic deliveries</p>
<p> up over the past 3 mths?		  38	    35</p>
<p>Were export deliveries up</p>
<p> over the past 3 months?		   26	    25</p>
<p>Do you expect to increase</p>
<p> workforce in the next 3 mths?	   22	    18</p>
<p>Have you experienced difficulties</p>
<p> in recruiting staff in last 3 mths?*  57	    55</p>
<p>Have you revised up investment</p>
<p>plans for plant and machinery</p>
<p> in past three months?		     21	    24</p>
<p>Will turnover improve in</p>
<p> next 12 months?			     57	    55</p>
<p>Will profitability improve in</p>
<p> next 12 months?			     45	    41</p>
<p>Is your firm operating at</p>
<p> full capacity?*			     46	    42</p>
<p>Has your cash flow improved in</p>
<p> the last three months?		    13	    15</p>
<p>-- Mike Peacock, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
